'''Malizabeth''' (ワルザベス, ''Waruzabesu'', '''Waruzabeth''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of [[Pigge]] introduced in [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] stages. She was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Malizabeth
|image = E 751.png
|first appearance = [[Anniversary/13th Year#Ep. 1: Heroes of Justice!|Ep. 1: Heroes of Justice!]]
|money drop = 600¢ - 2,370¢
}}

==Enemy==
This [[Pigge]] signed an Aku pact, giving her a [[Shield]] with 30,000 HP on top of her already high natural bulk. She does weak but rapid attacks that accumulate damage on your units over time, possessing a level 2 [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]] that can even strike your backlines. She drops a decent cash total, making it well worth the effort to take this fiend down.

==Strategy==
Use attackers like [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Scarf Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to break Malizabeth's Shield, and take it down with a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] for some extra money in otherwise difficult stages.

