==Trivia==
*Malizabeth's name is a pun on ''malice'', ''Elizabeth'' and possibly 魔 ''ma'' (demon).
*Malizabeth's Japanese name (ワルザベス ''Waruzabesu'', "Waruzabeth") is a portmanteau of 悪い ''warui'' (bad/evil) and エリザベス ''Erizabesu'' (Elizabeth).
*On release, Malizabeth's [[Shield]] ability did not display in the [[Enemy Guide]].

